The checkout integration issues (overselling and ghost charges) have been fixed by transitioning from a check-then-charge-then-decrement model to a secure, concurrent reservation model. We first decrement and reserve inventory under an `asyncio.Lock()`, proceed with charging via the payment gateway, and then roll back the reservation with an increment operation if the payment fails.

The simulation has been verified against the validator across multiple trials and achieves a perfect score. No further action is required.
